<title>USA: Airport Systems Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Airport Systems Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>OVERLAND PARK, Kan. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>AIRPORT SYSTEMS INTERNATIONAL INC</p>
<p>				Financial Highlights</p>
<p>						     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							   April 30,</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
<p> Sales				     $ 7,294,000    $ 4,567,000</p>
